### Add Fournisseur
POST http://localhost:8080/tricol_app_war_exploded/api/v1/fournisseurs
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Accept: application/json

{
  "societe": "ACME Supplies",
  "address": "123 Market St",
  "contact": "contact@acme.example",
  "email": "for@for.com",
  "telephone": "+1-111-1111",
  "ville": "rabat",
  "ice": "AA45GH45CF78"
}
