### Get List of Fournisseurs

GET http://localhost:8080/tricol_app_war_exploded/api/v1/fournisseurs

### Get Fournisseur By Id

GET http://localhost:8080/tricol_app_war_exploded/api/v1/fournisseurs/1

### Update Fournisseur By Id

PUT http://localhost:8080/tricol_app_war_exploded/api/v1/fournisseurs/1
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
Accept: application/json

{
  "societe": "ACME Update",
  "address": "123 Market Update",
  "contact": "App 48 rue 122",
  "email": "update@update.com",
